{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 13,
  "name": {
    "ja": "秘術の特異点",
    "en": "Node of Arcane",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 65,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "秘術の頂に至った観光客たちが、近くの森に燃素の特異点の存在を確認した。",
          "おまえはその特異点の場所を見つけ燃素を汲み上げてくるのだ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "Tourists who reached the summit of the mystery confirmed the presence of a burning element singularity in the nearby forest.",
          "You must find the location of the singularity and pump up the flammable element.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["よくやった。強力な魔法書を外に置いておいた。"],
        "en": ["You have done well. A powerful spellbook awaits you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "立ち去れ、観光客にも劣る無能め！",
          "永久機関となるべき燃素は消え去って永遠に失われたのだぞ！",
          "お前はせっかくのチャンスを棒にふったのだ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "Walk away, you incompetent, no better than a tourist!",
          "The fuel element, which should have been a permanent institution, has vanished and been lost forever!",
          "You have squandered your chance.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
